  "code" : "public int searchInsert(int[] nums, int target) {\n    int low = 0, high = nums.length - 1, ans = nums.length;\n    while (low <= high) {\n        int mid = (low + high) / 2;\n        if (nums[mid] >= target) {\n            ans = mid;\n            high = mid - 1;\n        } else {\n            low = mid + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return ans;\n}",
